<title>SWEDEN: TABLE-AVE YLD 5.87 PCT IN SWEDISH 5-YR BOND SALE.</title>
<headline>TABLE-AVE YLD 5.87 PCT IN SWEDISH 5-YR BOND SALE.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield in an auction of two billion crowns of Swedish five-year government bonds was 5.87 percent, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>					 Bond number 1039</p>
<p> Volume issued (billion Skr)	 1,998</p>
<p> Total bids (billion Skr)	    4,335</p>
<p> Number of accepted bids		  23</p>
<p> Number of bids			     47</p>
<p> Lowest rate			     5.859</p>
<p> Highest accepted rate		 5.874</p>
<p> Weighted average rate		 5.868</p>
<p>Percent served at highest rate 8.57</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
